             {loc:'strasbourg',n:'Strasbourg — 2 nights',time:'Sat-Sun',tip:'Saturday: Petite France half-timbered neighbourhood, Cathedrale Notre-Dame (tower climb 8euros). Winstub for dinner. Sunday: Alsace wine route villages by car or organised tour. Colmar 30 min by train.'}],
